{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/f13ecfd0c7a18718cdf10396cea3c901.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and precise melee combat focused on parries, counter-attacks, and fluid chains. Encounters are built around timing, reflexes, and control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.webm?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/4a3f4a217d25f97c8cb266c2fe550417.mp4?t=1754929930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/2df5ea393b8ce20143723172139e11fe.webp?t=1754929930\" width=409 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many elements in the environment can be sliced or destroyed. These interactions enhance both gameplay and immersion, creating tactical opportunities in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.poster.avif?t=1754929930\" width=680 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706790/extras/fce249eede40d905292e2ab3fa5ffc5b.webm?t=1754929930\" 